{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24900","headline":"伏览吕侍郎丘员外旧题十三代祖历山草堂诗因书记事 · 湛贲","name":"伏览吕侍郎丘员外旧题十三代祖历山草堂诗因书记事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名遂贵知己，道胜方晦迹。\n高居葺莲宫，遗文焕石壁。\n桑田代已变，池草春犹碧。\n识曲遇周郎，知音荷宗伯。\n调逸南平兆，风清建安迹。\n祖德今发扬，还同书史册。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"湛贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}